  "about": "One recipe per style card id. music_engine.py plays a recipe and has no style of its own: everything a style sounds like is here. Programs are General MIDI numbers counted from 0 (bank 0 unless `bank` is given); a drum kit is a bank-128 preset. A pattern is 16 steps of one bar (or 32 of two): X loud, x normal, o soft, - holds the note before, . is silence. Progressions are scale degrees of the recipe's mode; `voicing` stacks scale steps on each degree.",
